OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to murdering
OL,4,Amother in stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to murdering
OL,7,Fhis mother at the home they shared in a
OL,8,Fvillage in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to a property in
OL,11,FThe Crest, Linton, shortly after 14:30
OL,12,FBST on 21 June and found Joan Hardy
OL,13,Fwith stab wounds.
OL,15,FThe 72-year-old died at the scene and
OL,16,Fher son Adrian Hardy, 52, was
OL,17,Fsubsequently arrested and charged with
OL,18,Fmurder.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
