OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to murdering
OL,4,Amother in stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Derby Crown Court on Tuesday, he
OL,7,Fadmitted murder and will be sentenced
OL,8,Fat a later date, which Derbyshire
OL,9,FPolice said was expected to be in
OL,10,FDecember.
